{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2021-07-09 09:00:00', 'title': "MELISSA SCHAEFFER TO SUCCEED SCOTT CROCCO AS AIR PRODUCTS' CFO", 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., JULY 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER (CFO) SCOTT CROCCO PLANS TO RETIRE ON SEPTEMBER 30, 2021 FOLLOWING A DISTINGUISHED, 31-YEAR CAREER WITH THE COMPANY AND THAT MELISSA SCHAEFFER WILL SUCCEED HIM AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CFO ON AUGUST 10, 2021.'}